{"seq":1,"slug":"injury-signal-collection","title":"事故/伤害信号多源采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/safety-signal-incident-report/injury-signal-collection","wordCount":1524,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"事故-伤害信号多源采集\">事故/伤害信号多源采集</h1><p>召回失败的典型形态不是&quot;决策错了&quot;，而是&quot;早就知道却没人把它当回事&quot;。伤害信号从来不缺，缺的是把它从海量非结构化文本（客诉、差评、客服录音、监管通报、医院数据）里识别出来、归一化、并提升为可处置事件的那条流水线。这一篇讲的就是这条流水线的前半段：把信号从多源捞进来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-信号不等于事故\">核心概念：信号不等于事故</h2><p>客诉里 90% 是&quot;没收到货&quot;&quot;颜色不对&quot;&quot;尺码偏小&quot;，只有极小一部分指向人身伤害。如果让所有客诉都进伤害流程，审核队列会被淹没；如果只靠人工抽查，又会漏掉低频高危信号。因此需要一个<strong>分级漏斗</strong>：先用规则粗筛，再用模型或人工复核收敛。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[客诉/客服工单] --&gt; F[信号入口层]&#10;  B[商品评价与问答] --&gt; F&#10;  C[退货原因与质检记录] --&gt; F&#10;  D[社交舆情与论坛] --&gt; F&#10;  E[监管通报与召回公告] --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{伤害关键词/意图粗筛}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[普通售后流程]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[归一化: 产品/品类/伤害类型/时间]&#10;  I --&gt; J[去重与合并: 同一事件多源]&#10;  J --&gt; K[进入安全风险评估队列]&#10;  K --&gt; L{风险等级}&#10;  L --&gt;|需法定上报| M[事故报告流程]&#10;  L --&gt;|观察| N[持续监测]\">graph TD\n  A[客诉/客服工单] --&gt; F[信号入口层]\n  B[商品评价与问答] --&gt; F\n  C[退货原因与质检记录] --&gt; F\n  D[社交舆情与论坛] --&gt; F\n  E[监管通报与召回公告] --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{伤害关键词/意图粗筛}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[普通售后流程]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[归一化: 产品/品类/伤害类型/时间]\n  I --&gt; J[去重与合并: 同一事件多源]\n  J --&gt; K[进入安全风险评估队列]\n  K --&gt; L{风险等级}\n  L --&gt;|需法定上报| M[事故报告流程]\n  L --&gt;|观察| N[持续监测]</pre><p>入口层的多源不是&quot;越多越好&quot;，而是&quot;每加一个源，必须能说清它的信号特征是什么&quot;。评价区里的&quot;用了一次就断了&quot;和客服工单里的&quot;商品有裂痕要求退货&quot;指向的是同一件事，但文本特征完全不同，需要各自的抽取规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各信号源的抽取特征\">各信号源的抽取特征</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号源</th>\n<th>噪声特征</th>\n<th>有效信号特征</th>\n<th>抽取要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客服工单</td>\n<td>物流与售后占绝大多数</td>\n<td>含伤害描述、就医、报警</td>\n<td>结构化字段 + 文本关键词双通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品评价</td>\n<td>主观、情绪化、刷单混杂</td>\n<td>具体失效过程、重复出现的失效点</td>\n<td>按 SKU 聚合，关注同一描述重复出现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货原因</td>\n<td>编码粗粒度（&quot;不想要&quot;）</td>\n<td>原因码回填自由文本</td>\n<td>强制伤害相关原因码必填描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质检与维修记录</td>\n<td>只覆盖已退回商品</td>\n<td>失效模式可编码</td>\n<td>失效模式码需与危害类型对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管通报</td>\n<td>延迟、只覆盖已上报事件</td>\n<td>权威、精准</td>\n<td>用于反向校验自己是否漏报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>医院与伤害监测数据</td>\n<td>无产品识别、聚合统计</td>\n<td>品类级趋势</td>\n<td>只看趋势，不做个体归因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后两行的用法值得强调：监管通报和伤害监测数据不是用来&quot;发现自家产品出事&quot;的，而是用来<strong>校准自家检测器的灵敏度</strong>。如果某品类在公开召回榜上频繁出现而自己一条信号都没有，通常是采集规则太窄，而不是真的没事故。</p>\n<h3 id=\"伤害描述的关键词与规则\">伤害描述的关键词与规则</h3><p>粗筛规则要覆盖伤害的多种表达方式，纯&quot;受伤&quot;两个字会漏掉大量真实描述。下面是一个可落地的规则骨架。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;signal_rule_version&quot;: 5,&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;INJ-DIRECT&quot;,&#10;      &quot;priority&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,&#10;      &quot;patterns&quot;: [&#10;        &quot;割伤&quot;,&#10;        &quot;划伤&quot;,&#10;        &quot;烫伤&quot;,&#10;        &quot;烧伤&quot;,&#10;        &quot;触电&quot;,&#10;        &quot;哽噎&quot;,&#10;        &quot;窒息&quot;,&#10;        &quot;摔伤&quot;,&#10;        &quot;骨折&quot;,&#10;        &quot;过敏&quot;,&#10;        &quot;就医&quot;,&#10;        &quot;缝针&quot;,&#10;        &quot;急诊&quot;&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: [&quot;ticket_body&quot;, &quot;review_text&quot;, &quot;return_note&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;INJ-FAILURE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;priority&quot;: &quot;medium&quot;,&#10;      &quot;patterns&quot;: [&quot;断裂&quot;, &quot;脱落&quot;, &quot;爆裂&quot;, &quot;漏电&quot;, &quot;冒烟&quot;, &quot;起火&quot;, &quot;异味&quot;, &quot;过热&quot;, &quot;松动&quot;, &quot;破碎&quot;],&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: [&quot;ticket_body&quot;, &quot;review_text&quot;, &quot;qc_defect_note&quot;],&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;失效描述本身不等于伤害，但与 INJ-DIRECT 同单出现时升为 high&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;INJ-CHILD&quot;,&#10;      &quot;priority&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,&#10;      &quot;patterns&quot;: [&quot;小孩&quot;, &quot;儿童&quot;, &quot;婴儿&quot;, &quot;宝宝&quot;, &quot;幼儿&quot;, &quot;误食&quot;, &quot;误吞&quot;],&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: [&quot;ticket_body&quot;, &quot;review_text&quot;],&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;未成年人相关一律升为 high 并加速审核&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;escalation&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;same_sku_same_failure_within_days&quot;: 30,&#10;    &quot;occurrence_threshold&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;action&quot;: &quot;auto_promote_to_risk_queue&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"signal_rule_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INJ-DIRECT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"patterns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"割伤\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"划伤\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"烫伤\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"烧伤\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"触电\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"哽噎\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"窒息\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"摔伤\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"骨折\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"过敏\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"就医\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"缝针\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"急诊\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ticket_body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"review_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"return_note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INJ-FAILURE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"patterns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"断裂\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"脱落\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"爆裂\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"漏电\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"冒烟\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"起火\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"异味\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"过热\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"松动\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"破碎\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ticket_body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"review_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"qc_defect_note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"失效描述本身不等于伤害，但与 INJ-DIRECT 同单出现时升为 high\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INJ-CHILD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"patterns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小孩\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"儿童\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"婴儿\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"宝宝\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"幼儿\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"误食\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"误吞\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ticket_body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"review_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"未成年人相关一律升为 high 并加速审核\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"escalation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"same_sku_same_failure_within_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"occurrence_threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto_promote_to_risk_queue\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>escalation</code> 段是这套规则真正的价值所在。单条&quot;断裂&quot;客诉是噪声，但&quot;同一 SKU、同一失效描述、30 天内出现 3 次&quot;就是强信号——这正是 CPSC 在评估产品缺陷时看重的&quot;缺陷模式（pattern of defect）&quot;的工程化表达。用规则做模式识别，比把它交给审核员的记忆可靠得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归一化-让多源信号可比较\">归一化：让多源信号可比较</h2><p>不同来源的信号必须映射到同一套坐标，否则无法判断&quot;3 条客诉&quot;和&quot;1 条监管通报&quot;哪个更严重。归一化要产出四个维度：产品标识、危害类型、伤害后果、发生时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"危害类型的受控词表\">危害类型的受控词表</h3><p>危害类型必须用受控词表而不是自由文本，否则聚合时会散成上百个近义标签。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table harm_type (&#10;  code        text primary key,   -- physical_mechanical | thermal | electrical | chemical | choking | ...&#10;  label_zh    text not null,&#10;  severity_floor int not null     -- 该危害类型的最低严重度下限&#10;);&#10;&#10;create table safety_signal (&#10;  id             bigserial primary key,&#10;  source_type    text        not null,&#10;  source_ref     text        not null,&#10;  gtin           text,&#10;  lot            text,&#10;  harm_type_code text        references harm_type(code),&#10;  injury_desc    text,&#10;  occurred_on    date,&#10;  detected_at    timestamptz not null default now(),&#10;  severity       int,&#10;  dedup_key      text,          -- 归一化后用于合并的指纹&#10;  state          text        not null default &#39;raw&#39;&#10;    check (state in (&#39;raw&#39;,&#39;triaged&#39;,&#39;promoted&#39;,&#39;closed&#39;)),&#10;  unique (source_type, source_ref)&#10;);&#10;&#10;create index on safety_signal (gtin, harm_type_code, occurred_on desc);&#10;create index on safety_signal (dedup_key);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> harm_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  code        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- physical_mechanical | thermal | electrical | chemical | choking | ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  label_zh    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  severity_floor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     -- 该危害类型的最低严重度下限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safety_signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gtin           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lot            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  harm_type_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        references</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> harm_type(code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  injury_desc    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_on    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detected_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  severity       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dedup_key      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归一化后用于合并的指纹</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'raw'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'raw'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'triaged'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'promoted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'closed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  unique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source_type, source_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> index</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_signal (gtin, harm_type_code, occurred_on </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> index</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_signal (dedup_key);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>dedup_key</code> 是合并多源的关键。一个事故可能同时出现在客诉、评价和社交媒体上，如果不做去重，风险评估会看到&quot;3 起事故&quot;而实际只有 1 起，导致严重度高估；反过来，如果去重过猛把不同事故合并，又会低估。稳妥的构造方式是&quot;GTIN + 危害类型 + 发生日期（精确到天）+ 伤害部位&quot;，并对合并结果保留溯源链接。</p>\n<h3 id=\"未成年人信号的特殊处理\">未成年人信号的特殊处理</h3><p>含未成年人的信号应当强制进入快速通道：一是 GPSR 与 CPSC 都把暴露人群中的儿童列为加重因素；二是这类信号往往涉及玩具、婴儿用品等对时效极敏感的品类。规则上把它设为 <code>high</code> 并跳过常规排队延迟，是成本极低而收益很高的一个默认值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与监管侧数据的对账\">与监管侧数据的对账</h2><p>采集自己内部信号的同时，要定期拉取监管侧公开数据做对账。这不是为了发现别人的问题，而是校验自己的漏斗有没有漏。对账的口径可以很简单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"对账流程（每周）:&#10;  1. 拉取 Safety Gate 本周通报中与自家在售品类相关的条目&#10;  2. 按品类映射到自家 SKU 集合&#10;  3. 检查: 该品类本周是否产生过 safety_signal?&#10;       有  -&gt; 记录，检查是否已进入 triage&#10;       无  -&gt; 标记, 抽样 20 条客诉人工复核采集规则是否过窄&#10;  4. 输出: 漏检率估计 + 规则调整建议\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>对账流程（每周）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 拉取 Safety Gate 本周通报中与自家在售品类相关的条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 按品类映射到自家 SKU 集合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. 检查: 该品类本周是否产生过 safety_signal?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       有  -> 记录，检查是否已进入 triage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       无  -> 标记, 抽样 20 条客诉人工复核采集规则是否过窄</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 输出: 漏检率估计 + 规则调整建议</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 3 步的&quot;无&quot;才是对账的真正产出。连续多周某品类零信号，而公开通报持续有该品类案例，基本可以判定采集规则存在盲区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>信号不等于事故，必须先粗筛再收敛，避免淹没审核队列。</li>\n<li>六个信号源各有噪声特征，抽取规则需分别设计。</li>\n<li>监管通报与伤害监测数据用于校准灵敏度，而非发现自家事故。</li>\n<li>归一化产出四个维度，危害类型用受控词表。</li>\n<li><code>dedup_key</code> 决定多源合并的正确性，过粗与过细都损精度。</li>\n<li>未成年人相关信号强制走高优先级通道。</li>\n<li>信号进来之后如何定级，见 <a href=\"safety-risk-hazard-assessment\">安全风险评估与危害分级</a>。</li>\n<li>达到法定门槛后如何上报，见 <a href=\"statutory-incident-notification\">Safety Gate/CPSC 法定事故报告</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/1115.12\">16 CFR § 1115.12 — Cornell LII</a>（企业应研判的信息类型：工程与质检数据、诉讼与伤害索赔、独立检测机构信息、消费者投诉、政府机构信息；&quot;缺陷模式&quot;作为评估因素）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cpsc.gov/Research--Statistics/NEISS-Injury-Data\">NEISS Injury Data — CPSC</a>（基于全国代表性医院概率样本的伤害监测与回访系统，用于估计全国产品相关急诊量）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safety_Gate\">Safety Gate — Wikipedia</a>（欧盟危险非食品消费品快速预警系统，每周发布通报）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事故/伤害信号多源采集","id":"事故-伤害信号多源采集"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：信号不等于事故","id":"核心概念-信号不等于事故"},{"level":2,"text":"各信号源的抽取特征","id":"各信号源的抽取特征"},{"level":3,"text":"伤害描述的关键词与规则","id":"伤害描述的关键词与规则"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化：让多源信号可比较","id":"归一化-让多源信号可比较"},{"level":3,"text":"危害类型的受控词表","id":"危害类型的受控词表"},{"level":3,"text":"未成年人信号的特殊处理","id":"未成年人信号的特殊处理"},{"level":2,"text":"与监管侧数据的对账","id":"与监管侧数据的对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"技术文档、可追溯标签与合规标识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/product-safety-baseline/technical-doc-traceability-label"},"next":{"title":"安全风险评估与危害分级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/safety-signal-incident-report/safety-risk-hazard-assessment"}}